    "product_faq_iXcLnC": {
      "type": "product-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_Fq7LBp": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product"
          }
        },
        "tab_content_683zbz": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>What devices are compatible with this 3-in-1 charging station?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>This charging station is designed for Apple devices and supports iPhone 16/15/14/13/12 series, Apple Watch Ultra / 10 / 9 / 8 / 7 / 6 / SE, and AirPods with wireless charging case. It allows you to charge all three devices at the same time with one compact charger.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_fjWWzA": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Can I charge devices while the power bank itself is charging?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes, this charger supports pass-through charging, meaning you can charge your iPhone, Apple Watch, and AirPods while the power bank is plugged in. For the best performance, we recommend using a PD 20W USB-C adapter.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_Wrb3qd": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Does the charger support fast charging?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. The power bank supports PD 20W fast charging, allowing your iPhone 16 Pro to reach up to 55% in about 30 minutes. When using a 20W USB-C adapter, the power bank itself can recharge in around 3 hours.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_KQRxtY": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Is it safe to charge my devices overnight?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. The RORRY 3-in-1 charging station features an advanced smart protection system, including over-current protection, over-voltage protection, temperature control, short-circuit protection, and foreign object detection, ensuring safe and stable charging even overnight.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_NVT3iN": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Is this charger suitable for travel or flights?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. The compact foldable design and built-in 10000mAh battery capacity make it perfect for travel. It is airline-approved and small enough to fit easily in your bag or carry-on, so you can keep your devices powered anywhere.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        }
      },
